<title>UK: Saudi Aramco raises Jan LPG Contract Price to $330.</title>
<headline>Saudi Aramco raises Jan LPG Contract Price to $330.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Aramco has raised its Contract Price for Liquefied Petroleum Gas to $330 a tonne for both propane and butane in January.</p>
<p>This is an increase of $20 a tonne from the December price of $310 a tonne.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6412</p>
</text>
